{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47962","headline":"过台城感旧 · 沈青箱","name":"过台城感旧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六代旧山川，兴亡几百年。\n繁华今寂寞，朝市昔諠阗。\n夜月琉璃水，春风卵色天。\n伤时与怀古，垂泪国门前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈青箱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47962.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47962","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}